    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/dda70ec7aa33a5963fb2612f52dd75ca.avif?t=1738629169\" /></span><br><br>Age of Goblins is a casual RTS inspired by some classics of the genre, bringing chaos to the battlefield with frantic matches and a lot of tactical mastery while simplifying controls and mechanics, allowing you to sit down and have fun right away without spending hours learning how to play.<br><br>Your goal is to lead an expanding goblin tribe and conquer all stages, extinguishing rival tribes and keeping everything for yourself. It may sound a bit selfish, but they will also do everything to make you disappear from the map (literally), and you can't just stand there watching while arrows fly everywhere, right?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/1e5b67e056e0468c60200bf87ed2405f.poster.avif?t=1738629169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/1e5b67e056e0468c60200bf87ed2405f.webm?t=1738629169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/1e5b67e056e0468c60200bf87ed2405f.mp4?t=1738629169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/ef3802118eed8242ee45aad4b5e044c1.avif?t=1738629169\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Tactical Expansion:</strong> Conquer new caves, towers, and farms to grow your small empire of little creatures.<br><br></li><li><strong>Manage your stocks:</strong> Without food, goblins don't reproduce. Gather from nature or cultivate your own.<br><br></li><li><strong>Dozens of maps:</strong> Individually hand-drawn, with various biomes and different strategies for victory.<br><br></li><li><strong>Earn blessings:</strong> The gods reward those who do well in battle. Use abilities to turn the game in your favor.<br><br></li><li><strong>Chaotic pace:</strong> Hundreds of units crossing the map and invading your territories.<br><br></li><li><strong>Personal record:</strong> Record your best times and try new tactics to improve your performance.<br><br></li><li><strong>Build your tribe:</strong> Nothing like going to war with some visual customizations. It's good for self-esteem.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/fcc57a0c1af9b959393847cc18790add.poster.avif?t=1738629169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/fcc57a0c1af9b959393847cc18790add.webm?t=1738629169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/fcc57a0c1af9b959393847cc18790add.mp4?t=1738629169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/9e6857a8f00569c41fed5b5deb9bd9d1.avif?t=1738629169\" /></span><br><br>Don't be fooled by the cute visuals. Despite having simple commands, Age of Goblins can require a lot of agility and quick decision-making at times, just like the good old classic RTS games.<br>Some maps can be really challenging, so keep that in mind before playing, okay?!<br><br>* This is the dev's first published game, made solo and with a lot of love over the course of a year. By purchasing it, you contribute to the creation of new games and new experiences. My heartfelt thanks...<br><br>and may your tribe triumph!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/194fc14606dd9fdd500b0ef7190bce0f.avif?t=1738629169\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/dda70ec7aa33a5963fb2612f52dd75ca.avif?t=1738629169\" /></span><br><br>Age of Goblins is a casual RTS inspired by some classics of the genre, bringing chaos to the battlefield with frantic matches and a lot of tactical mastery while simplifying controls and mechanics, allowing you to sit down and have fun right away without spending hours learning how to play.<br><br>Your goal is to lead an expanding goblin tribe and conquer all stages, extinguishing rival tribes and keeping everything for yourself. It may sound a bit selfish, but they will also do everything to make you disappear from the map (literally), and you can't just stand there watching while arrows fly everywhere, right?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/1e5b67e056e0468c60200bf87ed2405f.poster.avif?t=1738629169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/1e5b67e056e0468c60200bf87ed2405f.webm?t=1738629169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/1e5b67e056e0468c60200bf87ed2405f.mp4?t=1738629169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/ef3802118eed8242ee45aad4b5e044c1.avif?t=1738629169\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Tactical Expansion:</strong> Conquer new caves, towers, and farms to grow your small empire of little creatures.<br><br></li><li><strong>Manage your stocks:</strong> Without food, goblins don't reproduce. Gather from nature or cultivate your own.<br><br></li><li><strong>Dozens of maps:</strong> Individually hand-drawn, with various biomes and different strategies for victory.<br><br></li><li><strong>Earn blessings:</strong> The gods reward those who do well in battle. Use abilities to turn the game in your favor.<br><br></li><li><strong>Chaotic pace:</strong> Hundreds of units crossing the map and invading your territories.<br><br></li><li><strong>Personal record:</strong> Record your best times and try new tactics to improve your performance.<br><br></li><li><strong>Build your tribe:</strong> Nothing like going to war with some visual customizations. It's good for self-esteem.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/fcc57a0c1af9b959393847cc18790add.poster.avif?t=1738629169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/fcc57a0c1af9b959393847cc18790add.webm?t=1738629169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/fcc57a0c1af9b959393847cc18790add.mp4?t=1738629169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555570/extras/9e6857a8f00569c41fed5b5deb9bd9d1.avif?t=1738629169\" /></span><br><br>Don't be fooled by the cute visuals. Despite having simple commands, Age of Goblins can require a lot of agility and quick decision-making at times, just like the good old classic RTS games.<br>Some maps can be really challenging, so keep that in mind before playing, okay?!<br><br>* This is the dev's first published game, made solo and with a lot of love over the course of a year. By purchasing it, you contribute to the creation of new games and new experiences. My heartfelt thanks...<br><br>and may your tribe triumph!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\